BWK-SP contains adapted code derived from SPDK:
https://github.com/cygnet3/spdk
revision: 8394a0cfa08d974f7aed1a1112a3d4caee6e63c0

Its BIP352 cryptographic core derives from SPDK's vendored
silentpayments implementation. SPDK imported that implementation from:
https://github.com/cygnet3/rust-silentpayments
in SPDK commit:
3d033a399d40d9ffa38726484233237645c14db4

The BIP352 send and receive test vectors in
tests/resources/send_and_receive_test_vectors.json are the public BIP352
test-vector fixture also used by rust-silentpayments and SPDK.

The BIP374 DLEQ proof code is ported as part of the SPDK
silent-payment implementation. Its tests use the public BIP374 test
vectors.

